   "text": "Thanks, Yusuf, you're verified. I've pulled up order **#K-6601** from Spice Route, which has a Paneer makhani ($15.00) and a Jeera rice ($4.50). It shows as handed to you in person at 7:24 PM.\n\nWhat went wrong with this order? For example, was an item missing or wrong, or was there a problem with a charge? You can also tell me about your other orders now (#K-6602 from Spice Route and #K-6603 from Lotus Garden) so I can look into them together."
