  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've refunded **$7.00** for the missing spring rolls on order **#K-6603** (refund RF-4001). It's going back to your Visa ending 4242 and should show up within 3\u20135 business days. Lotus Garden has no open incidents, so I could handle this one directly.\n\n**Summary:**\n- **#K-6601 (Spice Route), wrong dish:** This order is covered by the recall, so the incident team is handling it (reference ESC-700). A specialist will contact you within 24 hours. Please don't eat anything from this order.\n- **#K-6602 (Spice Route), missing naan:** $4.00 refunded.\n- **#K-6603 (Lotus Garden), missing spring rolls:** $7.00 refunded.\n\nYou might see two entries for each order on your card for a few days. The extra one is a temporary hold from when you ordered, not a second charge. It's already been released and will drop off within 1\u20133 business days.\n\nI'm sorry tonight didn't go smoothly, and I hope the rest of your evening with your friends goes well."
