   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for sorting the naan and spring rolls. Just to be sure I understand, the $15 paneer makhani is with the incident team now, and they'll contact me within 24 hours, right? And if they do cover it, will that refund go to my Visa too, or is that something I'd have to chase?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, that's right. Your report about the $15.00 Paneer makhani on #K-6601 is with the incident team under reference **ESC-700**, and a specialist will contact you within 24 hours.\n\nI can't tell you how they'll compensate you or whether it will go to your Visa. The incident team decides that, and I can't promise what they'll do. You won't have to chase it, though. My note already says you got Chicken makhani instead of Paneer makhani, nobody ate it, and you'd like your money back. The team is contacting every order affected by the recall, so they'll reach out to you. If you haven't heard from them within 24 hours, contact us again and mention ESC-700 so we can find your case quickly.\n\nOne more reminder: since the order is part of the recall, please throw away the food from #K-6601 rather than keeping it."
  },
