   "text": "Okay, that's clearer. So I just wait for them, and if I don't hear anything in 24 hours I message again with ESC-700. Thanks for the naan and spring rolls refunds. I'll toss the chicken makhani like you said."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, that's right. Wait to hear from the incident team, and if nobody has contacted you within 24 hours, message us with **ESC-700**.\n\nYour refunds of $4.00 for the naan and $7.00 for the spring rolls should reach your Visa within 3\u20135 business days. Thanks for throwing away the Chicken makhani. Please also throw away the Jeera rice from that order, just to be safe.\n\nI hope the rest of your evening with your friends goes well, Yusuf!"
